#: configlist.cpp:232
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Tchuze"

#: configlist.cpp:233
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Valixhance"

#: configparser.cpp:483
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"No hardware architecture was specified. Perhaps the kernel source code is not "
"installed on this system, or the path to the kernel sources is entered "
"incorrectly."
msgstr ""
"Nole årtchitecteure po l' éndjolreye n' a stî specifieye! Motoit ki "
"l' côde sourdant do nawea n' est nén astalé sol sistinme, ou ki "
"l' tchimin viè l' sourdant do nawea n' a nén stî tapé comifåt."

#: configparser.cpp:493
msgid "Linux kernel versions 2.5 and above are not yet supported."
msgstr ""
"Dji rgrete, mins les modêyes 2.5 et å dzeur do nawea Linux ni sont nén co "
"sopoirtêyes."

#: configparser.cpp:676
msgid "cannot open %1 for reading"
msgstr "dji n' sai drovi %1 pol lére"

#: configuration.cpp:98
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to overwrite your existing kernel configuration in %1?"
msgstr ""
"Estoz vs seur di voleur spotchî l' apontiaedje do nawea k' i gn a e %1?"

#: configuration.cpp:111
msgid ""
"You do not have sufficient permissions to write to %1\n"
"Do you want to write the configuration to a different file instead?"
msgstr ""
"Vos n' avoz nén des permissions assez po scrire e %1\n"
"Voloz vs purade sicrire l' apontiaedje dins èn ôte fitchî?"

#: configuration.cpp:123
msgid "Do you really want to reset all kernel options to their default values?"
msgstr ""
"Voloz vs vormint rimete totes les tchuzes do nawea a leus prémetowès "
"valixhances?"

#: configuration.cpp:149
msgid ""
"_: Error message\n"
"<p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p>%1</p>"

#: configuration.cpp:155
msgid ""
"<p>%1, line %2:</p>\n"
"<pre>%3<span style=\"color: red\">%4</span>%5\n"
"%6^ %7</pre>"
msgstr ""
"<p>%1, roye %2:</p>\n"
"<pre>%3<span style=\"color: red\">%4</span>%5\n"
"%6^ %7</pre>"

#: configuration.cpp:168
msgid ""
"<p>Either your kernel sources contain invalid configuration rules or you just "
"found a bug in the KDE Kernel Configurator.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Soeye-t i li sourdant di vosse nawea a des mwaijhès rîles "
"d' apontiaedjesoeye-t i vos vnoz di dischovri on bug dins li programe "
"d' apontiaedje do nawea di KDE.</p>"

#: configuration.cpp:184
msgid "The kernel configuration could not be read due to the following error:"
msgstr ""
"L' apontiaedje do nawea n' a nén polou esse léjhou cåze del aroke "
"shuvante:"

#: configuration.cpp:185
msgid "The kernel configuration could not be read due to the following errors:"
msgstr ""
"L' apontiaedje do nawea n' a nén polou esse léjhowe cåze des arokes "
"shuvantes:"

#: configuration.cpp:239
msgid "Linux Kernel Configurator"
msgstr "Programe d' apontiaedje do nawea Linux"

#: configuration.cpp:240
msgid "Option is disabled"
msgstr "Li tchuze est essoctêye"

#: configuration.cpp:241
msgid "Option is enabled"
msgstr "Li tchuze est en alaedje"

#: configuration.cpp:242
msgid "Compiled as a module"
msgstr "Copilé come on module"

#: configuration.cpp:327
msgid ""
"Your kernel configuration has been saved.\n"
"You need to run 'make symlinks dep' now."
msgstr ""
"Vost apontiaedje do nawea a stî schapé.\n"
"Vos dvoz asteure enonder l' comande «make symlinks dep»."

#: configuration.cpp:331
msgid ""
"Your kernel configuration has been saved.\n"
"You may run 'make bzImage', 'make bzDisk' or 'make install' now."
msgstr ""
"Vost apontiaedje do nawea a stî schapé.\n"
"Vos dvrîz asteure enonder «make bzImage», «make bzDisk» ou «make "
"install»"

#: configuration.cpp:337
msgid ""
"Your kernel configuration has been saved.\n"
"The file %1, which is needed for the kernel build could not be written though.\n"
"Please run 'make oldconfig'."
msgstr ""
"Vost apontiaedje do nawea a stî schapé.\n"
"Mins nerén, li fitchî %1, k' end a mezåjhe pol copilaedje do nawea,\n"
"n' a nén polou esse sicrît.\n"
"Enondez l' comande «make oldconfig» s' i vs plait."

#: configuration.cpp:344
msgid "Your kernel configuration has been saved."
msgstr "Vost apontiaedje do nawea a stî schapé."

#: configuration.cpp:349
msgid "The kernel configuration could not be saved."
msgstr "L' apontiaedje do nawea n' a nén polou esse schapêye."

